 4 │ theorem bad (f: Nat → Nat) (g: Nat → Nat) (h: [n: Nat] → f n = g n): (y: Nat) → f y = g y :=
   │                                                                      ────┬───  
   │                                                                          ╰───── write `∀ (…) =>` instead of `(…) ->`
